nd":"event","title":{"zh":"探测器已回收","en":"Probes Collected"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们已经成功回收全部的失联亚光速探测器！其中涉及我们文明的详细数据现在已经安全，不会再被外星人窥视。\n\n通过这些探测器的遥测协作，我们得以完全测绘周边数个星系。","en":"We have successfully collected all of our missing sublight probes! The detailed information they held on our culture is now safe from prying alien photoreceptors.\n\nWith their combined sensor telemetry, we have been able to fully survey a number of additional neighboring systems."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/02c1afacf0760697e03b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_1.txt","line":1205},"sets":["completed_sublight_probes"],"alsoIn":["event-country-6","event-country-9","event-country-11","event-country-14","event-country-16","event-country-18","event-country-20"]},{"id":"country.5","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"离子轨迹","en":"Ion Trail"},"texts":[{"zh":"[Root.GetName]接收到了废弃信标发出的信号，该信标原属于[Root.GetStarName]星系失联的亚光速探测器之一。我们发现一条离子轨迹从信标延伸至另一个恒星，这表明该探测器被拖向该恒星，具体原因不明。","en":"The [Root.GetName] has picked up a signal from a discarded signal buoy belonging to one of our missing sublight probes in the [Root.GetStarName] system. There is an ion trail leading away from the buoy on a trajectory towards another star, suggesting that someone has towed the probe there for unknown reasons."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/02c1afacf0760697e03b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"country.5.a","label":{"zh":"我们去看看这条轨迹一直通到哪里。","en":"Let us see where this trail leads."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"sets":["chasing_ion_trail","probe_salvage_flag"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_1.txt","line":432},"names":{"Root.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"},"Root.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"}}},{"id":"country.10","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"亚空间异常现象","en":"Subspace Anomaly"},"texts":[{"zh":"[Root.GetName]在[Root.GetStarName]星系中探测到了规模巨大的亚空间异常。异常的中心似乎是我们丢失的亚光速传感器之一！","en":"The [Root.GetName] has detected a massive subspace anomaly in the [Root.GetStarName] system. It appears to be centered on one of our missing sublight probes!"}],"sections":[],"image":"art/02c1afacf0760697e03b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"country.10.a","label":{"zh":"我们务必谨慎前进。","en":"We must proceed with caution."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"sets":["probe_subspace_anomaly_flag"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_1.txt","line":742},"sets":["subspace_anomaly"],"names":{"Root.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"},"Root.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"}}},{"id":"country.12","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"改造探测器","en":"Modified Probe"},"texts":[{"zh":"一个扫过[Root.GetName]的传感器在[Root.GetStarName]星系发现了我们的一个亚光速探测器，可是似乎……有些不太一样了。探测器外壳上加装了外星技术的改造部件，且能源特征远超正常水平。我们接收到了它发送过来的信号！","en":"A sensor sweep from the [Root.GetName] has revealed one of our sublight probes in the [Root.GetStarName] system, but it seems to have been... altered somehow. Modifications of an alien origin have been attached to its hull, and the probe's energy signature is far greater than it should be.\n\nWe are receiving a transmission from it!"}],"sections":[],"image":"art/02c1afacf0760697e03b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ONSCREEN","label":{"zh":"显示在屏幕上。","en":"On screen."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"country.13","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/country_events_1.txt:1026","story":"event-country-2"}],"terminal":false,"sets":["modified_probe_flag"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_1.txt","line":973},"sets":["modified_probe"],"names":{"Root.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"},"Root.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"}}},{"id":"country.13","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"探测器意识","en":"Probe Consciousness"},"texts":[{"zh":"嘶嘶吱吱……你们是……我的造物主吗？","en":"Shhblzxtfrgr... are you... the Makers?"}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"country.13.a","label":{"zh":"是的，我们制造了你。","en":"Yes. We made you."},"responses":[{"zh":"咳呀呀……那么……你们……就……去死吧……","en":"Krtxltilgr... then... you shall... die..."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"country.13.b","label":{"zh":"不，你到底是什么？","en":"No. What are you?"},"responses":[{"zh":"嘻咦……你们的……末日……","en":"Rrkgkthxxft... your... doom..."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/country_events_1.txt","line":1035}}]}